================================================================================
WHAT THIS COVERS
================================================================================

Everything in this repository, both halves of it:

  THE GAME
    * The Player's Book, The Keeper's Book, and The Bestiary — text, tables,
      stat blocks and layout, in every form they ship in: the built HTML, the
      PDFs, and the prose embedded as strings inside build_player.py,
      build_keeper.py and build_bestiary.py.
    * assets/ — the cover emblem.

  THE SOFTWARE
    * GK/ — GritKeeper: the C#/.NET rules library, the WinForms app, the test
      suite, and the JSON data under GK/rules/Data/.
    * The Python build pipeline and verification tools (build_*.py,
      nav_tools.py, perdition_map.py, pag_patch.py, make_pdf.py,
      extract_creatures.py, update_readme.py, verify_rules.py, measure_*.py,
      audit_*.py).
    * sign.ps1, package.ps1, and the GritKeeper/ packaged mirror.


